    {
      "id": "fx8wee6",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "10. Important Facts"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "vowh1pi",
      "content": "• Mitochondria are called the powerhouse of the cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "n2ib0od",
      "content": "• Lysosomes are called suicide bags."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "a242ih1",
      "content": "• Ribosomes are the site of protein synthesis."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "v8f08n7",
      "content": "• Nucleus controls cell activities."
    }
